   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "MoodCraft · More like this (Flux Klein)\n\nImage to image: encodes the Load Image picture and re-samples it. denoise on the KSampler is the strength: 0.3 subtle, 0.7 default, 0.9 loose. Change the seed for each take.\n\nModels (Flux 3 Image Klein, int8): diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-int8-convrot.safetensors, text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors (type flux3), vae/flux2-vae.safetensors.\n\nSame graph MoodCraft queues; the app fills in prompt, seed, size and images itself. Core ComfyUI nodes only."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "MoodCraft · More like this (Flux Klein)\n\nImage to image: encodes the Load Image picture and re-samples it. denoise on the KSampler is the strength: 0.3 subtle, 0.7 default, 0.9 loose. Change the seed for each take.\n\nModels (Flux 3 Image Klein, int8): diffusion_models/flux3-image-klein-base-int8-convrot.safetensors, text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors (type flux3), vae/flux2-vae.safetensors.\n\nSame graph MoodCraft queues; the app fills in prompt, seed, size and images itself. Core ComfyUI nodes only."
